# 🌸 Iris Flower Classification

## Description

This project classifies Iris flowers into three species using the Decision Tree algorithm.

## Dataset

- Iris Dataset (Scikit-Learn)
- 150 flower samples
- 4 input features
- 3 output classes

### Features

- Sepal Length
- Sepal Width
- Petal Length
- Petal Width

### Target

- Setosa
- Versicolor
- Virginica

## Algorithm

- Decision Tree Classifier

## Libraries Used

- scikit-learn

## Workflow

1. Load Iris Dataset
2. Split Training and Testing Data
3. Train Decision Tree Model
4. Predict Species
5. Calculate Accuracy

